    "title": "第一次说晚安",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "library_reading_day",
    "music": "B15",
    "who": "narration",
    "text": "她没有立刻回答。桌上那本薄笔记被她按住一角，纸张微微弯起来。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 18,
    "next": "r_claude.07.added4"
