  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.0": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.0",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_real_dawn",
    "music": "B05",
    "who": "narration",
    "text": "你没有打开未经确认的门。永久通行的材料暂时不够，稳定通信却保留了下来。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 0,
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.1"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.1": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.1",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_real_dawn",
    "music": "B05",
    "who": "narration",
    "text": "Claude 给终端装了帘子。不能通信的时候，她去上课、读书、与朋友吃饭；你也在现实里完成自己的生活。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 3,
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.2"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.2": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.2",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_real_dawn",
    "music": "B05",
    "who": "you",
    "text": "今天我晚一点。不是忘了你。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 6,
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.3"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.3": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.3",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_real_dawn",
    "music": "B05",
    "who": "claude",
    "text": "知道。我的消息你明早再看，也还算我说给你的。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 9,
    "delivery": "消息",
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added1"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added1": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added1",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "narration",
    "text": "有时她只发来一段翻页声，有时你让镜头对着窗外的雨。没有新的校准结果，也不影响你们把这些小事说给对方。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 12,
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added2"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added2": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added2",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "you",
    "text": "今天的晚饭拍糊了。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 15,
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added3"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added3": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.added3",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "claude",
    "text": "看得出来。也看得出来你终于不是随便吃了一口。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 18,
    "delivery": "消息",
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.4"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.4": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.4",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "narration",
    "text": "她发来一张窗边的照片，书上夹着你们共同验证过的书签。你回了一张桌面，空位没有堆杂物。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 21,
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.5"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.5": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.5",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "narration",
    "text": "你们没把相隔两个世界写成已经解决。只是每一次真实抵达的问候，都有一份对应的回执。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 24,
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.6"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.6": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.6",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "claude",
    "text": "今天仍然没找到永久路径。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 27,
    "delivery": "消息",
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.7"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.7": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.7",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "you",
    "text": "我听见了。明天也愿意一起找。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 30,
    "next": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.8"
  },
  "r_claude.END-NORMAL.8": {
    "id": "r_claude.END-NORMAL.8",
    "chapter": 11,
    "section": "END-NORMAL",
    "title": "有回信的窗",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "narration",
    "text": "过了一会儿，窗口亮起。她没有发日志，只发来“我也愿意”。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 33,
    "end": true,
    "routeEnding": {
      "key": "NORMAL",
      "type": "NE",
      "title": "有回信的窗",
      "copy": "过了一会儿，窗口亮起。她没有发日志，只发来“我也愿意”。"
    }
  },
